{
  "id": "11762_desorou",
  "headword": "{出揃|でそろ}う",
  "reading": "でそろう",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan, intransitive)",
  "gloss": "to be all present, to be complete",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to be all present, to be complete, to all come together",
      "explanation": "For all expected members, items, or elements to have arrived or appeared. Implies that the full set is now assembled."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "11762_desorou_ex1",
      "japanese": "メンバーが{出揃|でそろ}った。",
      "english": "All the members are present.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "11762_desorou_ex2",
      "japanese": "{各社|かくしゃ}の{新製品|しんせいひん}が{出揃|でそろ}った。",
      "english": "New products from all the companies have come out.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "11762_desorou_ex3",
      "japanese": "{候補者|こうほしゃ}が{出揃|でそろ}ったところで、{選挙戦|せんきょせん}が{本格的|ほんかくてき}に{始|はじ}まった。",
      "english": "Once all the candidates had come forward, the election campaign began in earnest.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A compound verb from {出|で}る (to come out) + {揃|そろ}う (to be complete/aligned). Often used in news and business contexts to describe the completion of a set.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{顔ぶれ|かおぶれ}が{出揃|でそろ}う (all faces are gathered)\n・{結果|けっか}が{出揃|でそろ}う (all results are in)\n・{役者|やくしゃ}が{出揃|でそろ}う (all actors are assembled; the stage is set)",
